---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok Tour Package – Khao Sok Delight"
  description="3 day, 2 night Khao Sok Tour Package - stay in a Forest Room at Riverside Cottages, enjoy the best activities, get the best priice!"
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/three-day-khao-sok-package-2.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok Tour Package – Khao Sok Delight"
  heroSubtitle="Curated Rainforest Adventures & Park Excursions"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Tour Package Delight", "href": "/khao-sok-tour-package-delight/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Delight 3 Days, 2 Nights Khao Sok Tour Package</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Day 1: </strong>Our friendly staff will greet you upon arrival, and show you to your room. Spend the rest of the day relaxing, swimming in the river, and exploring the area around the resort.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Day 2: </strong>Start the day with breakfast at our riverside restaurant. Afterwards head to the Khao Sok National Park for a half day hike or choose an hour long Thai massage in the comfort of your own room. After returning to the resort for an independent lunch, explore the river with a <a href="/khao-sok-canoe-trip-sabai-sabai/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">guided canoe trip</a> or take a more adventurous <a href="/khao-sok-river-tubing/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">river tubing trip</a> (during the rainy season). Spend the rest of the afternoon relaxing under the trees or having drinks in the riverside lounge.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Day 3: </strong>Start day 3 of your Khao Sok Tour Package with a complimentary breakfast.  Now choose whether to head to the sanctuary for elephant bathing, or visit a local family farm for <a href="/khao-sok-jungle-cooking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">jungle cooking with bamboo</a> and enjoy a fantastic meal. Check out before lunch time, and relax until you leave for your next destination.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you would like to spend more time with an elephant, please inquire about changing from an elephant bath to the <a href="/khao-sok-elephant-sanctuary/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Elephant Retirement activity</a>.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>This Khao Sok Tour Package includes breakfast, all other meals are not included.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Price does not include entrance fee to National Park (only if you choose hiking on Day 2).</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="my-12">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Thailand-Elephants-1.jpg"
                alt=""
                class="w-full h-48 sm:h-64 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
               width="1200" height="800" />
              
            </figure>
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
                src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/three-day-khao-sok-package-2.jpg"
